5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's find that werewolf quickly. I'm not letting anyone get hurt!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, young Takumi. Wisdom comes to those who observe. Let us begin with calm hearts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. Let's try to get along and figure this out together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll be watching everyone's reactions. It's better to be cautious at the start.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should analyze the patterns of speech before jumping to any conclusions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't have time for just ""watching""! We need to be proactive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Being proactive is a virtue, but haste can lead to errors. What do you think, Midori?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think we should just listen to each other for now. Does anyone have any initial suspicions?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,It's too early for suspicions. I'm just observing the dynamics.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. Any accusation made now would be based on nothing but intuition, which is unreliable.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, but if I see something fishy, I'm calling it out immediately!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,That spirit is admirable. Just remember that the truth often hides in the quietest places.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll do my best to help everyone stay positive. We can do this!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
