31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I know who the werewolf is. It's Midori!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,"That was sudden, Takumi. Please tell us why you've reached this conclusion.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, why would you say that? I haven't done anything!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"A direct accusation on the first day. That's a bold move, Takumi.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, are you claiming to be the Seer? If so, providing evidence is necessary.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yes, I'm the Seer! I checked Midori last night, and she's the werewolf!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"If that is true, the path is clear. But we must be certain. @Midori, any words?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'm completely innocent! I'm just a villager. Takumi must be mistaken or lying!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Takumi is the Seer, Midori is the wolf. If Takumi is the wolf, he's framing her.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The logic is simple. However, we must consider if there is a Possessed player trying to confuse us.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not lying! I'm the one protecting you guys! Vote for Midori!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I trust the conviction in your voice, Takumi. It feels sincere.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Please, everyone! I'm not the werewolf! I want us all to survive!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Midori's reaction is typical. It doesn't prove innocence or guilt. I'll trust the Seer's claim.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"While I prefer more data, the Seer's role is the most efficient way to end this. I'll follow the lead.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
